# Gmail-Native Design Style

Build or edit UI in a minimal Gmail/Google Workspace style.

- Keep layouts clean, compact, and low-noise.
- Use neutral surfaces, subtle borders/elevation, and restrained radius.
- Keep typography simple and readable.
- Use predictable, subtle hover/focus/active states.
- Reuse existing project UI patterns before creating new ones.
- Avoid flashy visuals (heavy shadows, gradients, glassmorphism, decorative effects).
